### Prevent users with specific roles from being synced

To prevent users with a specific role from being synced, you can use the following snippet. Change the roles to be skipped in the array in [line 3](#upt-sync-skip-user-by-role-L3).

```
How to use custom PHP code?PHP code can be added to your (child) theme's functions.php file. Alternatively, you can use the Custom Hooks add-on, or a code snippets plugin. More infoadd_filter( 'upt_sync_skip_user', function( $bool, $user_id ) {
