### Only sync users with a specific role

To sync only users with a specific role, you can use the following snippet. Change the roles to be synced in the array in [line 3](#upt-sync-preserve-user-by-role-L3).

```
How to use custom PHP code?PHP code can be added to your (child) theme's functions.php file. Alternatively, you can use the Custom Hooks add-on, or a code snippets plugin. More infoadd_filter( 'upt_sync_skip_user', function( $bool, $user_id ) {
  $roles = (array) get_user_by( 'ID', $user_id )->roles;
  $roles_to_preserve = [ 'student','teacher' ]; // Sync only these roles

  $intersect = array_intersect( $roles, $roles_to_preserve );
  if ( empty( $intersect ) ) {
    return true; // Skip users not in $roles_to_preserve
  }

  return $bool;
}, 10, 2 );
```

