### Display the post distance in the marker info window content

If you are using a [Proximity facet](/help-center/facets/facet-types/proximity/) together with a Map facet, it is possible to show the post distance in the info window that appears when a marker is clicked.

To do so, open your Map facet’s settings, and add the following PHP code to the [“Info window content” setting field](#add-or-customize-marker-info-window-content-with-the-info-window-content-setting):

