#### Change the order of dates in the facet

To change the order of the dates in the facet, you can [use the facetwp_facet_orderby hook](/help-center/developers/hooks/querying-hooks/facetwp_facet_orderby/#sort-by-date). If you set the "Sort by" setting of the facet to "Raw value", it will order dates in 
