```
How to use custom PHP code?PHP code can be added to your (child) theme's functions.php file. Alternatively, you can use the Custom Hooks add-on, or a code snippets plugin. More info// Change date order to DESC. We're using the facet_value which is yyyymmdd for ACF date fields
