#### Trigger a full re-index after an import

If you are importing large datasets it is more efficient to re-index the entire site after an import. To do this, use the following snippet instead:

```
How to use custom PHP code?PHP code can be added to your (child) theme's functions.php file. Alternatively, you can use the Custom Hooks add-on, or a code snippets plugin. More info// Run a full re-index of all posts after the import has finished
function facetwp_reindex_all_posts( $import_id ) {
  if ( function_exists( 'FWP' ) ) {
    FWP()->indexer->index(); // Run a full re-index of all posts 
  }
}
add_action( 'pmxi_after_xml_import', 'facetwp_reindex_all_posts' );
```

